---
description: After changing Vue frontend code, run vue-tsc. Docker production builds fail on type errors.
globs: vue_frontend/**/*.vue, vue_frontend/**/*.ts, vue_frontend/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# Frontend type-check

`npm run build` (and Docker) runs `vue-tsc --build`. Type errors fail the image.

After changing any file matching these globs:

1. From `vue_frontend/`, run `npm run type-check`
2. Fix every error before finishing
3. Ignore Vite chunk-size warnings — they are not type-check failures
